<title>CHINA: Yeebo year net loss HK$18.51 mln.</title>
<headline>Yeebo year net loss HK$18.51 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   4.10 loss  vs 17.92 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  29.05 loss vs 17.59 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    18.51 loss vs 80.54 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     353.17     vs 307.22</p>
<p>    Company name		 Yeebo (International Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Yeebo manufactures liquid crystal displays and printed circuit boards.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$12.2 million on provision for diminution in value of a subsidiary not consolidated, loss of HK$13.95 million on disposal of fixed assets, loss of HK$3.9 million on provision for settlement to National Bank of Canada, loss of HK$0.7 million on provision for diminution in value of other long term investments and gain of HK$1.69 million over provision of interest in relation to prior years unrecorded borrowings.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs one H.K. cent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
